more|PASS: More string, want more biscuits and more clearly demonstrate determiner, pronoun and degree adverb; all examples preserve added quantity versus manner comparison.
pedestrian|PASS: Traffic-context person-on-foot noun is accurate; driver waiting at an entrance and Vietnamese người đi bộ preserve the event without claiming an adjective Sense.
somewhat|PASS: Limited degree on a comparative is accurate and có phần reflects it; more-formal-than-a-bit note is qualified rather than a fixed CEFR assignment.
wildlife|PASS: Wild animals collectively fit the source boundary and uncountable grammar; watching from a path preserves animal distance and does not serialize a real person's data.
dog|PASS: Domestic canine, companion/work role and puppy distinction are accurate; soft-toy/gate example is original and countable noun usage works.
